Paul and Ringo  Prince Harry visited London's iconic  Abbey Road Studios on Friday to meet up  with musician John Bongiovi the 35 year  old Duke of Sussex and the 57 year old  musician are teaming up for Harry's  beloved Invictus games the event he  founded for wounded injured and sick  military veterans to compete in sports  based on their abilities to mark the  occasion the Invictus games choir joined  Bon Jovi to re-record his song unbroken  I was very aware of what he's done the  good works he'd done in the Invictus  games and I said I've got an idea  because I think that the soldiers  knowing that they had a choir could sing  this song tell their story it would  promote the games  [Music]  the pair also posed for photos with  members of the Invictus choir in the  iconic crosswalk outside of the studio  The Beatles recorded their many iconic  hits before the studio sesh John joked  about Harry dropping his royal title I  was wondering what do I call him now and  I've come up with the idea he's going to  be known as the artist formerly known as  Prince Harry and Megan announced their  plans to step down as senior members of  the royal family in January and will  split their time between Canada and the  UK going forward but when it comes to  security  turns out Megan and Harry it will soon  be paying for their own in a statement  to Reuters the Canadian office of the  Minister of Public Safety said that once  Megan and Harry are no longer senior  members of the royal family the country  it will not cover the cost of their  security which the outlet reports is  estimated to cost millions of dollars  and according to the statement the Royal  Canadian Mounted Police have been  assisting London's Metropolitan Police  with security for the Duke and Duchess  of Sussex intermittently since November  the change is happening very soon the  couple is scheduled to officially step  down as senior members of the royal  family on March 31st it doesn't change  who I am or how committed I am  but I hope that helps you understand  what did it come to that I would step my  family back from all I have ever known  to stick is to take a step forward into  what I hope can be a more peaceful life  [Music]
 

